# Copy to ignored .dev.vars for LOCAL testing only. Replace each placeholder locally.
# Use wrangler secret put for production; never put real values in vars or this file.
READ_TOKEN=REPLACE_WITH_RANDOM_32_BYTE_DASHBOARD_SECRET
MCP_TOKEN=REPLACE_WITH_DIFFERENT_RANDOM_32_BYTE_MCP_SECRET
# Optional manual workflow writes; use a third independent private value.
# It also authorizes Mac sync grants, flags, shares, retention and every backup route,
# including backup reads. For a restore drill, keep it in its own 0600 file and pass
# --review-token-file; never put it on a command line.
# REVIEW_TOKEN=REPLACE_WITH_DIFFERENT_RANDOM_32_BYTE_REVIEW_SECRET
# Backups need no secret here: BACKUP is an R2 binding in a private Wrangler config,
# and MAINTENANCE_TASKS / BACKUP_* are plain vars. Keep both out of this file.
# Optional Access configuration is not sensitive, but must be configured as a pair.
# ACCESS_TEAM_DOMAIN=REPLACE_WITH_TEAM.cloudflareaccess.com
# ACCESS_AUD=REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_APPLICATION_AUDIENCE
# Optional Jev evaluator key for background processing (BACKGROUND-PROCESSING.md).
# Use a key issued for this service only; never borrow one from another Cloudflare
# project or application. Keep it commented for local review: the synthetic tests use
# a fake provider, and without a key no external call is made. A call also needs the
# EXTERNAL_PROCESSING_PROJECTS var, a reviewer policy and a nonzero daily budget.
# JEV_API_KEY=REPLACE_WITH_DEDICATED_JEV_KEY_FOR_THIS_SERVICE_ONLY
